# Example Caddy reverse proxy config - gives you free auto-renewing HTTPS
# (required by Telnyx's webhook and by the browser for mic access) in front
# of the Node app. Install Caddy, drop this at /etc/caddy/Caddyfile (with your
# real domain), then: sudo systemctl reload caddy
your-domain.example.com {
    reverse_proxy localhost:3000
}
